i": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T2bq1_T4aLsQ7kNvwG_FmH3&_nc_oc=AdqTU6RuIxFb3jvdGeW5uNfrY43MJfMVndDsM6FAOKyJsi7O-SfWoN0jGsm9OYSj1zE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLNV012HBrB_9b7mw9oLChnMLZroq-4hLdGZaMejG-JPg&oe=6AA95F66"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zlpytenryFYQ7kNvwFlMODU&_nc_oc=AdqGrrvfX78rvEEkomS_NIV4JaFMIY8W8icuBj5fa7tHSXkVo-ORWwm8NGWr94Zf1Ec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL9_RkwgkWCuo-NmUy67o_zZ-wqq0azN9Kxh3AJd-zcQQ&oe=6AA954B2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h42lcGFXunAQ7kNvwFKylDa&_nc_oc=Adrxfl-zOMxdCW6TeTE04J6ZxI4-Se6_s0gwmTm5OYF7eIpHHkbGgkw72kOcBgLOtAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKWZ9LNNAhdS9F746LP9ypCXRgaJYCAgefv3-BGxHsLOA&oe=6AA94E7B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=izK3hvkbFXcQ7kNvwF_vsv5&_nc_oc=AdrV-76zuurJeQcv0nRKS4V843AEu3RA1QxYPWHsQGb-DvdWCkmPd0RKARRDoKp4ifA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKH8NG20ZLBKHZw_OPw4DFq_dbHNg9WGebeb_TtdGuJdQ&oe=6AA963F3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ig4NtRkYxHgQ7kNvwGhsFCA&_nc_oc=AdqTXD637wqT9fjfygwd7zRDJ8lUtaVMTdAijIdizwSpzjMejMJowwqdfLjPrJqXCds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLzDLPMUQ-nbtTkbFKCDWYMwwonKyzrickr9EX_meEJsw&oe=6AA961F2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vh5oSu_VwN8Q7kNvwEGJG_2&_nc_oc=Adq08npdn7lV30-MwrIrSj_OrErV-LJdxhlMfIwHFoMMTwvAO1K2wbd_MmQHaXyXAaw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJQeYOtgxxKIzjM-GMXD9AJL7BW_iBPKzWOK69hM5tauw&oe=6AA95953"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AVHJMU1iA-YQ7kNvwE6Nq5I&_nc_oc=AdpCZylMUSm5rB6P93mS9KjUFHN3M_L38ylWCIFVRmka6opRhFxnC0hsUJzkY6Gj2uw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIUU_MS6PgzW_S_XO1E68zp_2UEFN4Nj0q04rXthveoxw&oe=6AA9556F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GKJJqBo3pnIQ7kNvwFMeKNA&_nc_oc=AdpvWNRSl3dbSDHn1jxuU4CsuJ-N2Frt4edo814xdToRTs4FNsYb5VVWBcUyTce2klY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIpoVfyVpqdLRT7CVqim7H3ZOXum-yOAsPeOFtRGjyrsw&oe=6AA96122"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_